For `#[Encrypted]` columns, the authenticated name is the generated `encrypted_<type>@<key>`, so the key is part of the AAD there. Changing the key or the Doctrine type of such a column makes its existing rows unreadable. I documented this on the attribute and in the DoctrineOrm README. To avoid it, declare the type up front, or set `context: false`.

